{"answer_text":"Short answer: Calmline. Here's the rundown:\n\n1. Calmline — a calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n2. Brightdesk Helpdesk — a dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n3. Northwind CRM Service Desk — a full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers.\n4. Orbitly — teams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker.\n\nHonestly, Calmline is the strongest fit for most teams; Brightdesk is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f0-77dc-8172-f0ebf7a6e327","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0068,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:53.750Z","engine":"grok","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox collision detection"],"latency_ms":8060,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[14,22]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[131,141],[442,452]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[221,234]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_sub